{
  "item": "Grass01",
  "mu_name": "Grass",
  "mu_name_from": "Lorencia's object slot 20. WorldObjectCatalog.cs runs Grass as a block of eight from 20, so Grass01.bmd is type 20.",
  "world": "lorencia",
  "object_type": 20,
  "why_this_one": "Placement count. the commonest tall grass, 175 of them. Lorencia stands 1031 clumps of grass between the seven kinds - 36% of everything in the town - and each one is a handful of crossed cards wearing a cut-out sheet, so the cheapest assets in the map are also the ones that fill most of it.",
  "profile": "world",
  "sheets": {
    "tree_08": "tree_08.png"
  },
  "sheet_from": "Data/Object1/tree_08.OZT, from MuMain. All are cut-outs and ship as .OZT because that is MU's TGA.",
  "sheet_materials": {
    "tree_08": "foliage"
  },
  "material_note": "foliage throughout, which is what it is. No normal map: the geometry is a flat card and the shape the eye reads is the alpha, so embossing a leaf texture across it announces that it is a picture printed on a board.",
